    "label": "android.yml (CI)",
    "language": "yaml",
    "descriptionZh": "独立导出工程的 GitHub Actions 自动构建配置。",
    "descriptionEn": "Standalone GitHub Actions build workflow for exported .zip project.",
    "content": "name: Build LSPosed & LibXposed APK\n\non:\n  push:\n    branches: [ \"**\" ]\n  workflow_dispatch:\n\njobs:\n  build:\n    runs-on: ubuntu-24.04\n    steps:\n      - name: Checkout Source\n        uses: actions/checkout@v5\n\n      - name: Set up JDK 17\n        uses: actions/setup-java@v5\n        with:\n          distribution: 'temurin'\n          java-version: '17'\n\n      - name: Accept Android SDK Licenses\n        run: yes | \"$ANDROID_HOME/cmdline-tools/latest/bin/sdkmanager\" --licenses > /dev/null || true\n\n      - name: Setup Gradle 8.9\n        uses: gradle/actions/setup-gradle@v6\n        with:\n          gradle-version: '8.9'\n\n      - name: Build Signed Single-DEX Release APK\n        run: gradle assembleRelease --no-daemon --stacktrace\n\n      - name: Upload Compiled APK\n        uses: actions/upload-artifact@v4\n        with:\n          name: bard-quota-hook-v1.9.0-release\n          path: app/build/outputs/apk/release/*.apk\n"
